# game/custom/mods/Courtyard/courtyard_scene.rpy:47
translate chinese_simplified courtyard_scene_2c01905f:

    # sill "Welcome to the villa, Master. We are keeping [_cy_count] of your girls here in [_cy_district_name] — the rooms can house up to [_cy_limit] of them."
    sill "欢迎回来，主人。我们在这儿——[_cy_district_name]——替您安置了 [_cy_count] 位女孩，房间最多可容纳 [_cy_limit] 位。"

# game/custom/mods/Courtyard/courtyard_scene.rpy:50
translate chinese_simplified courtyard_scene_7c337c74:

    # sill "The rent comes to [_cy_rent] gold tonight, on top of their upkeep. [_cy_diff_name] times, Master — every district charges more for its rooms, and the landlord raises his rates as your household grows."
    sill "今晚的租金是 [_cy_rent] 金币，这还不含她们的日常开销。如今世道艰难（[_cy_diff_name]），主人——每个地区的房租都在涨，您家人口多了，房东还会加价。"

# game/custom/mods/Courtyard/courtyard_scene.rpy:51
translate chinese_simplified courtyard_scene_bab20ad6:

    # sill "And do visit them once in a while. Idling day after day dulls a girl's skills, especially in... challenging times."
    sill "有空也请常来看看她们。日复一日地闲待着会荒废女孩的本事，在这种……艰难时期尤其如此。"

# game/custom/mods/Courtyard/courtyard_scene.rpy:53
translate chinese_simplified courtyard_scene_755e8a9b:

    # sill "The villa is empty right now, so there is no rent to pay. Should you ever need the extra rooms, you know where to find us."
    sill "别院现在是空的，不用交租金。哪天您需要额外的房间，知道去哪儿找我们。"

# game/custom/mods/Courtyard/courtyard_scene.rpy:60
translate chinese_simplified courtyard_scene_ac67cfaf:

    # sill "Ah — before I forget. Word is the crown is selling land grants here in the King's Hold. With one of these deeds, the villa could be expanded into a proper estate."
    sill "啊——差点忘了。听说王城正在出售土地特许状，凭这种地契，别院可以扩建成一座真正的庄园。"

# game/custom/mods/Courtyard/courtyard_scene.rpy:62
translate chinese_simplified courtyard_scene_01bbb2c6:

    # sill "The asking price is a kingly sum — [courtyard_villa.EXPANSION_PRICE] gold, to be precise. I know, I know... but it would lift the room cap entirely. You can review the offer from the facilities panel."
    sill "开价是王室手笔——确切地说，[courtyard_villa.EXPANSION_PRICE] 金币。我知道，我知道……但它能彻底解除房间上限。您可以在设施面板里查看这笔交易。"

# game/custom/mods/Courtyard/courtyard_scene.rpy:64
translate chinese_simplified courtyard_scene_c7dd2b93:

    # you "Ten million gold for a bigger courtyard. Sill, remind me to fire whoever came up with that idea."
    you "一千万金币就为了让庭院大一点。Sill，提醒我开除出这个主意的人。"

# game/custom/mods/Courtyard/courtyard_scene.rpy:66
translate chinese_simplified courtyard_scene_b29ec914:

    # sill happy "Noted, Master. Shall I tell them before or after they take your money?"
    sill happy "记下了，主人。要我在他们收您钱之前还是之后转告呢？"

# game/custom/mods/Courtyard/courtyard_scene.rpy:98
translate chinese_simplified courtyard_loop_ea1488ad:

    # sill "[_cy_name] put in a quiet hour of practice at the training ground. Slow and steady, Master."
    sill "[_cy_name] 在训练场静静练了一个时辰。稳扎稳打，主人。"

# game/custom/mods/Courtyard/courtyard_scene.rpy:100
translate chinese_simplified courtyard_loop_4e7dc007:

    # sill "I'm afraid [_cy_name] is in no state to train right now."
    sill "恐怕 [_cy_name] 现在的状态没法训练。"

# game/custom/mods/Courtyard/courtyard_scene.rpy:118
translate chinese_simplified courtyard_loop_9b37a488:

    # sill "[_cy_name] has been released from your service, Master. She seemed... relieved."
    sill "[_cy_name] 已经获得自由了，主人。她看上去……如释重负。"

# game/custom/mods/Courtyard/courtyard_scene.rpy:120
translate chinese_simplified courtyard_loop_14f5c9a4:

    # sill "[_cy_name] has left the villa, Master."
    sill "[_cy_name] 已经离开别院了，主人。"

# game/custom/mods/Courtyard/courtyard_scene.rpy:132
translate chinese_simplified courtyard_loop_ba4bf50d:

    # sill "[_cy_msg] The workmen will have it ready by tonight."
    sill "[_cy_msg] 工匠们今晚就能完工。"

